Subject: CPMS I03E Corpus Replay Report Source
Description: Manager-derived source for the final static I03 formation slice: an immutable, obligation-driven corpus that compares I03D reader observations under explicit common syntax claims, reports every mismatch and coverage gap, and proves exact pure replay without claiming semantic validity, compatibility, or authority admission.

